<div class="page-wrap docs-overview"><header class="page-hero"><div class="page-hero__text"><h1>Docs</h1><p>How to start with <code>material</code>, use it in your framework, theme it, and how it works. Each component's API is on its Develop tab.</p></div><div class="page-hero__art" aria-hidden="true" data-shape="dunes"></div></header>
<div class="page-hero-body"><% [...it.guideGroups, ...it.docGroups].filter(group => group.items.length).forEach(group => { %><section class="docs-group"><h2><%= group.label %></h2><div class="docs-grid"><% group.items.forEach(item => { %><%~ it.docCard(item) %><% }); %></div></section><% }); %></div>
</div>
